    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "Group rules: Where a reading has no unit, the WGPT_UNIT data shall be set to \"UNITLESS\".\nUnits included in WGPT_UNIT shall be fully defined in the UNIT group (Rule 15), the unit group is case sensitive.\nData type for data field heading WGPT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      {
        "@value": "WGPT_CAS defines if the reading was carried out in open hole, cased hole, PVC cased. Example of WGPT_CAS include: OH = Open hole; CH = Cased hole; PVC = PVC cased; 6IN = 6 inch casing; PQ = PQ size casing; SLOT = Slotted casing\nRefer to parent group for definition of WGPG_TOOL, WGPT_PARA.\nWhere the heading has no unit the WGPT_UNIT data variable shall be set to \"UNITLESS .",
        "@language": "en"
      }
